          "type": "p",
          "text": "每一級都只用中間一格，一份換一份，最適合拿漏斗送料，見[[crafting/magician_table]]。"
        },
        {
          "type": "recipe",
          "items": [
            "essentialcraft5:mru_shard",
            "essentialcraft5:mru_crystal"
